  "overview": "The incredible Darius arcade saga enters the next generation faster than a meteor, hotter than a blazing sun! You are the last son of a dying star. Command your state-of-the-art Silver Hawk attack ship and hunt enemy squadrons to the ends of the universe!\n\nIntense shooting action! 28 enemy-packed levels! Smart bombs! Wave lasers! Homing missiles! Multi-stage power-ups! Cooperative two-player action!\n\nThe odds are against you... the fate of Darius lies in your hands!"
